This repository has the code, original data, and processed data used in the manuscript by DeLong et al in Ecology
Publication data might be 2026 or 2027

Files are organized in folders.

We pulled auxiliary data to pair with the data from OS-Prey. These data are stored in the "auxiliary data" folder. See metadata therein for description. See original sources for complete details.
Data on barn owl diets come from the OS-Prey database (Uiterwaal et al 2026)
Data on mammal body sizes come from EltonTraits (Wilman et al 2014)
Data on mammal density come from Santini et al 2022

Analysis involved several steps. The code for these steps is in the "code" folder.
We first processed the OS-Prey diet data to pair it with auxiliary data and create summary information. These tasks are in the file "Process diet data from OS-Prey.jl".
We conducted an allometric assessment of variation in density. This is in the file "Small_mammal_density_allometry_OLS.jl".
The analysis script is "baow_optimal_foraging_analysis.jl".

Code was last run in Julia 1.13
